{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6077d460a50702fd87b27a7e70ed9ef7587ed5d54191e444775350cdd4bffcb",
      "text": "温暖的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4453bdd6e65f9f407ccd1976a5c42fe448e63f1c88e026a7b9e23efefe824a3",
      "text": "向因突降大雨而困扰的咲搭话的卷绪，\n以感冒了可不得了为由，提议她去自己\n打工的地方避雨。\n被带到Cafe Parade的咲，\n在那里遇到了幸广。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6077d460a50702fd87b27a7e70ed9ef7587ed5d54191e444775350cdd4bffcb",
      "text": "温暖的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad8e3193c44b5703e568caa78a7f28f859b0651241e68129ce1e6279051e63c",
      "text": "那个，我是在回家的路上被雨淋了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0186356afad58bbdcd579b7dd90073ea85f24e8bfdcdd558b45fc2a6ed9e5300",
      "text": "那可真糟糕呢。\n……对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62664dbf3956b612a9e82c443c9ed6de0c3fccaebe6c888947d6330b013fd908",
      "text": "我现在正要去打工的地方。\n不介意的话，要不要跟我一起去？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e824978f22a6bfe2a9946ece3c4ee778fa452af50dd53fdc1550f852db1fb9cf",
      "text": "一直呆在这里身体会着凉的哦。\n你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79fcce1f12425a0b4814be16b2420b254449a0fa37461f9a043e3d7f83110fd3",
      "text": "可以吗？可是这孩子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:416f00512ffc38edc54ccfb6940ba132bb37d967ffb50772c41bac11c077faee",
      "text": "那就带上它一起走吧。\n这样下去，你们两个都会感冒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eeb4fcb2dbd4e1bbb88f32ade92198bb758b2acb0234b57266c16efdf022511",
      "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命，跟着你走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff9dc6d92d3b734a747b62efe9c0259c2e4ad3b8ebf02fecbccd6f431484291",
      "text": "那我们就出发吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8ffd16313fa913ee8c43991c64e9bcb67d01a83d8d50f71ea31cea459295cb",
      "text": "（啊……为了不淋到我们，\n他把伞倾斜过来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83994cb16a2c3d0dd5fd96a674d012009fb7791b7ed3c4d14e6b242e9a316d2e",
      "text": "（对遇到困难的人能毫不犹豫地施以援手，\n既温柔又帅气呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c7ac550b8e6423a4349eaca1ed5023c35da98931d91d35e38142d4c8f2f327",
      "text": "说起来，你叫什么名字？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c6c1ffbfce626a27abe417f1b9b6fe104dc3c3c5d2271ee299af1d79612504",
      "text": "我叫……咲！水岛咲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e90c768d8c36cb3c6b4dc848c90de70f53743816d87ae8265ee10ec9a25a6048",
      "text": "我是卯月卷绪。\n请多指教啦，水岛同学！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32422daa9388d2963730340e0143b27d9385f0654c02a8a1f9f88c8ab509ec7e",
      "text": "欢迎光临Cafe Parade！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b98e0cfd034e863a9f85407386801e169e16ad2c8060e18924602167a7b561c",
      "text": "这里就是我打工的地方哦。\n稍等一下下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8c81ce16bb69f0e2b119dd24799c2b08ea30c268c0ebd5c21cc2be8741abf30",
      "text": "（哇啊……超级可爱！\n好棒的店啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911363c32da402dec3c467f0e6bd375d61fcf7151460cde525daa601d85594e3",
      "text": "水岛同学，久等了。\n给，毛巾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16704380c93fa87f1402b6f473235988cfc56270bba01d1ed134288d0f24bdd",
      "text": "谢谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608bffae2e5d27e5b8c7bae73987bbf9f75c5b2eef197fee3bad950bb6e2a9ac",
      "text": "初次见面，我是店长神谷。\n情况我都听卷绪说了。真倒霉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:901918eeaaf35f3f3368b3a4658f53d6391e41560f57c20a3ca9da8f02609302",
      "text": "初次见面！我是水岛咲。\n那个，非常感谢您让我来避雨。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2852d17280697050f21229d099bb367d646d371e672e1bc3ebcdc3d8d73cb07e",
      "text": "互相帮助是应该的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e32b83b8164ec4279bd95016d0d189ed1ec71905379bf72a8ab1e03113107ec5",
      "text": "我准备了热红茶。\n来，请往这边坐……这位小姐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_b:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f47021e2631c86f3a0943b1254f1ffde2223475d38ffb7db0c9012979d86d9f",
      "text": "（这位小姐！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38e88102d3be5d4abf476bcbd3c559d20fdbbc46f07d2e5d4949dc61ede993a8",
      "text": "久等了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db12b7f307b2a53702f7e6bf7bf1799ec798630134bf24c3bbfab56ac3b17b6",
      "text": "哇，好啪噼可爱的甜点！\n红茶闻起来也很香～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56457c505b3d76c39959a2b4049f91a95db9d35cda876f493b9b4c4172c6cbc2",
      "text": "啊……不过我没带多少钱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c97ab2d7faacc9fa93a02ccd1e56fd5626b9cd1f1a8c7f6a859b76858b5d0e",
      "text": "请不用在意。\n这是我们的一点心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e825bfb051b76473593601c7a581c68b72381cc450dbfcbbbf8002a81cf9d59",
      "text": "神谷先生的红茶和庄一郎先生的蛋糕\n都超级好吃的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d481b167ac4a8370643a1e1b8d122cb10ef59e84f3fe5ec31baa2c4e02487e25",
      "text": "两位……谢谢你们。\n那我就开动啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a969ee9744c942338c93fb95496a626008c98f92a7855a7653e87f4114c7323",
      "text": "……！\n这个蛋糕，超级好吃～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db01e5ed4e088a5980c4ccd293eaf1ab3be8d1c33a7ed3519595c4feab57d007",
      "text": "是吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e96152f750112c6983c1c6a47e41684a7906c60addf034cdefaa9496a5054f77",
      "text": "红茶也很香很好喝！\n跟蛋糕是绝配呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:902a7d3b2a82a387206a5215f586c50d913e70cf1e10b7310fd6e595cf0d87d5",
      "text": "（刚才本来还有点消沉的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:701d52e123c943c2abcfca861792935785c61ae8d2626ddf0cd49592c082f30c",
      "text": "（卯月君的温柔，红茶的温暖……\n还有蛋糕温和的甘甜，让人感到好幸福）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40393198d3c4f0d017ba5bdbf473c0d1a60ed87c79c23c7afcb60f4b2d549c65",
      "text": "（Cafe Parade啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_c:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c41b3c045bd91fd525b438962636f67213a2af17df90751b412f27d0f66ed3a",
      "text": "……咦？\n呐，那边摆着的是国外的照片吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec7bfb44139d42124327128eeb01f9f3e1c3bcfbb9b5eb45b36ae0e0c0ea4a81",
      "text": "里面拍的是神谷先生吧。\n您喜欢旅行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962d7897c9ef66ada467a1eaff56886723d622df9049090e276bfcdcaa3b93d4",
      "text": "是的。在开店之前，我曾周游过\n很多国家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af3c51b7fb65fcc113616c42ecf185cdbd26688af13775676c9def5c16dbb6c2",
      "text": "在那段旅程中的相遇，\n促成了我开这家店的契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14bbf4a7f39455285f12e39bfa02f27bce1f2e42b63796237bf032c1353417b1",
      "text": "哇～！是怎样的旅行呢？\n可以的话能跟我讲讲吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54c155feebc546862a2853aff2451dc187756867c9c4d34801cdcc4a3850b2e4",
      "text": "我也想听。我也想听神谷先生旅行时的\n故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7be0d9857a06335f7cde27ffbda7e4df83a8f42a2660dd492b896478f7edce53",
      "text": "在某国旅行的时候，我曾经遇到强盗，\n变得身无分文。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec1493fe621c3f34bc3d4940c57ec67d384091b33f10a4ebbe44113d17ee7bc",
      "text": "虽说保住了性命，但身处人迹罕至的荒野深处\n动弹不得，备受饥饿与干渴的折磨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1985ce8fe5ba939e9177d8a2471940d0a2a9f47d63dcd492dd43d0d089a82354",
      "text": "就在迎来了堪称人生最大危机的时候，\n有一位男性出现了，对倒在地上的我说道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a68e0022ad9869a1cf89eee47deea8a764314cbfdc973f84ed85690ecfb79e8",
      "text": "“Hey boy！\n来本大爷的小餐馆吃一顿吧。包你能上天堂！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c23d9a81e4129f13c4e2d3cba6851c94e74f2a8e9f4f9dd8e9669c77953f914",
      "text": "那位男性的餐馆，\n简直就像个小小的马戏团。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b713d7f039eebd9da9e01f3f4f283731116def5b73174a03c3ade2b22efa210",
      "text": "色彩斑斓的三明治和饼干，\n外观自不必说，味道也十分华美、令人愉快……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07847ec6ccd648c3f2242e40d3408f476044efd893fdb50a1dff4d25bf7f0840",
      "text": "那份宛如Parade（游行）般的款待让我深深感动。\n特别是餐后的红茶，堪称极品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3150c012b6e0d7b8aa37de934c00f0e69549b45079e77cee0dd473a35b1b5ca3",
      "text": "那时的我毫无人生目标，只是在盲目地旅行。\n……但是，那次相遇让我拥有了梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc159c1a0e372eaa98551041299e516f3fd575fba9eeff8e57d39701b3a4e2e",
      "text": "我也想开一家像他那样，能成为某个人的归宿，\n让任何人都能获得幸福的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa567e57472f08af103c40cfabaaede6047c9aacf71a98e91caa923d304db6c3",
      "text": "之后为了开店，我前往英国\n开始了红茶的修行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9167c5f2b196299b356fd0208be122b0c8b5fc6bcef253944c90b92dabbbe8",
      "text": "对当时那家小餐馆的男性和那一杯红茶，\n我怎么感谢都不为过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6990290370807dcc898b358f10bb7226762834b3f74fade286ea9e2d46b998",
      "text": "我究竟得到了多么大的拯救与幸福啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbcd96f3e302c598b128a535e9c8a12a46468fcf47521e7229f9926467b6b663",
      "text": "呵呵！行动力真强。\n……不过神谷先生的心情，我也能明白。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b1e198f5a65f1ac9e293f3895657765ba6a6cc7210d5da147c7ff524b7bd2a",
      "text": "因为神谷先生的红茶和店里温暖的氛围，\n也让我感受到了幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56bbd57e0b822e90d56db2317bd37bcbf399333bc46e7dc19c424718d4b7b2c4",
      "text": "（……如果在这里的话，\n“我”也许就能作为“女孩子的我”活下去了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203330604d3a5843cc57a84f27b412460446ef155c36570f5ac8d2d389207221",
      "text": "（卯月君和神谷先生，好像都没注意到\n我是穿着女装的打扮）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8311101354663b1d84f18def50c101bd3242866dc2f6d90533f44624ef32fb89",
      "text": "（……就算被识破了，在这里也许也没关系的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f1f9eb70ea3bb7216bc559286bf1bf8a0e63551e44d1437fdc2c15ebdd79493",
      "text": "那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31d925f5ea92085267a4ffadeae39b8eede38d1aca3f2988809e6831cb4c03c",
      "text": "这里在招兼职吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e8bd1c641df25fe7a7e623a767278b866330c02b57fa27045d2a114f49dd6bc",
      "text": "哎，兼职吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d3bd16093b3d92b9b8b218672fb1c907cc281a860139ae59e93926717eef1f",
      "text": "是的！我想在这里工作。\n拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab3590d7308dcbb00b6b3c46c77be99e9d275fc861bf38e7f2adb74aef81cac0",
      "text": "哈哈，之前也遇到过类似的事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef5eb92c85a8dcb733d95b3e17bdc280a963cb0a8599bcb39c5060139a8becc0",
      "text": "虽说有卷绪加入了，\n但Cafe Parade确实人手不足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0ff808e506f5429a4a036d5e352880956f45f5dc4da91b5b276c4ff464ae03",
      "text": "水岛同学愿意来工作的话，倒是帮了大忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:647bb78a31a9d45bd69a0d422fd168243a0af900361f52e39053d6a5ac5e6e2b",
      "text": "话虽如此，光凭我一个人是没法答复的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2349fdc06bcb6f40d4777849a598ae2c936389757cc5642bdec5406b4a8e342d",
      "text": "店里的钱包掌管在另一个人手里，\n我得去跟他商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116c0c6af2025980a95cb4d4bbaa8ec3b48285bc9ca094d71d9404e089c489e5",
      "text": "好的！拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:778a4fb7b9ea6c935c2d8a111ef3291f0533e4df82c08e125706e25617afd016",
      "text": "我是从今天开始在Cafe Parade兼职的\n水岛咲！请啪噼地多多关照☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e447bbe63af7508d28421c397807a59a9dd2ad6687ccdbcc8121656962021ab",
      "text": "我们才要请你多关照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6180d259e4b1cb19076f0ea5e464813d634919b9582df46a90a69882799b2950",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢你准备了这么啪噼可爱的制服。能穿着\n这样的衣服工作，我超级开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9fe7fa58c48dfc4cfb78261fe433a00dbbea8ade49f4f31043217fa5c114b74",
      "text": "（啪噼……？是异国的语言吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aeda2c0b730f464250db92f1e49fc967e3b8388a9ecca351e1c1acc1b4fa6d0",
      "text": "（又来了一个古怪的人呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef5641a8e291d6cf89ba3dd9eef3f382bea0d19719318ec4d5fd436e09db468c",
      "text": "对了！今天有想送给大家的东西哦。\n当当——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4eb18fe50618eae6684a3264fb2dafa131c3575fbb64aea12631db94cfbcd8",
      "text": "唔，这是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9b68cc162adaa23dc8c78f3a5d0a074004e3d8c9f2ba4dae77359e5cb90334",
      "text": "我想着能不能帮上什么忙，就和卷卷一起\n买了蛋糕回来！这就是所谓的刺探敌情？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b4d8fa868e2e547bd56f0ced2eceb4b065f07f8beaa07fb165a30cd1386faae",
      "text": "是最近在我学校附近新开的店里的哦。\n有很多新奇口味的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d11bb3090960a55cac458846d78202632e4ebb918c0b72ff170d2a78a3b8b680",
      "text": "嚯，那还挺耐人寻味的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9397201b5b0cbcd4bffae8498704719a2beeb750a00db4b23c7691fb16cb81fb",
      "text": "对吧对吧！\n蛋糕的夹层里放了红豆馅……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ae387aad286cec36d958d65ebd414972dbf848c86f8514f5079e18d59714d7e",
      "text": "庄一郎，你怎么了？\n脸色好苍白啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6caeb7ff9a66183e32d78d0a1583023f21a73915c27c3a2b41da888d6c9f36e7",
      "text": "不好意思，稍微有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7b7a375e3e3255846395cd5c69cbd7ca3cecaf3f612116b931c9afd56dd9ad",
      "text": "没事吧？\n卷绪、咲，不好意思。东云他吃不了红豆馅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:497c4daa56972b6d89022b13ed6e876283738472403c7e9570b51db7126af5a1",
      "text": "哎！？是这样吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf40e03da686d1f7ab21b611abecc06464a69b24c3ed4983d12ea9999ea98c2",
      "text": "是的，其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a6aea69ddfeddc0a27d0b5ac33d1e7a47590062fbeb48133ab7c29c2fe1e4d7",
      "text": "……因为我的老家是开日式点心店的，\n所以曾想方设法试图克服过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9366434bf6dfcd566d358d990732e69d7beed447cf5589bbf7e8e5ba0d1a4d",
      "text": "但这样逼迫自己的结果，反倒变得越来越应付不来了。\n……吓到你们真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3d9bcd7a1e69eb18df64bb83a4defdb1aaac536eca9662986e9330b0ebb9be",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n对不起哦，庄一郎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4d8aefce74daa346b16715fcaf7486877bbc48918eb76d659615dbdefb6894",
      "text": "我也，非常抱歉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6a65c3d2457f4973bd06ae305eb13046cd98205582fd6a90083784096ca475",
      "text": "不，该道歉的是我。而且二位希望能为店里\n出力的心意，我很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f744464f67ec6d54e71335db165763ff88c7fe2ccc8c6bfc6c8c2fa585e41d61",
      "text": "看来我同意雇佣二位来打工的眼光，\n并没有出错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc20f12cb07271a4e616039dd9798a70fc4a8d5fb0f793d5368ba4ac1201d066",
      "text": "那么，庄一郎先生的那份就由我来吃！\n考察也请交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed00e9bc379c51180cfaeca4a56679abf536c7b3b61b6e4a971b57229ae462d",
      "text": "好，那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022780b460fcd59987f263b39f2eb0f17c4f8d92783914623a936df28852ad7d",
      "text": "户外活动，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63c1b0dd78a129a53a96618328044e28be5a86f308a96fdbe9bf9d67debce9b2",
      "text": "是的！在偶像团体的户外活动上，\n要不要来摆个咖啡摊位呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5128374865d75bb335f020b90b1a9e919dad8a7759281c183c6fce304fdcd513",
      "text": "个性丰富的店员，加上美味的料理与红茶。\n以及会为客人讲述旅途故事的店长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a79b9cdc8f8ccc24bd7787b4621f8cc6147c38ce5d89658c042e667b803033",
      "text": "我们非常希望能邀请现在人气急剧上升中的\nCafe Parade各位前来出店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64cad118295c0e988ba3c78eb3ba4eedc69af8d69650e282f2f43281a758fb4",
      "text": "居然是户外活动！太厉害了——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2f7de96d9d03c75013b28141738e13f8122b6af5dd37c7592938c598ad0855",
      "text": "活动啊。应该会聚集很多人，\n在招待上也得拿出干劲才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2656386f8ed5e91c8d694c5a615cf365e308d944d77b50d140740035e40dc808",
      "text": "是的！希望能招待很多很多客人，\n让他们带着幸福的心情享受活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a841515ca0b12fcce713056dd741242e7cda63fb4bc0e4661873e6b763ac1c",
      "text": "嗯。而且对Cafe Parade来说，\n应该也是个很好的宣传机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4399c0bfbc65c6281b9ca5bc85c745243d4ef9abec31bfe199d4dac66c49ff09",
      "text": "吾亦赞成。以此等吾等精制之暗之食粮，\n震颤光之子民的心灵吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463e81eec2d22f8157715174f43c5b65371b00d31781a23c822367dc279b154e",
      "text": "好，那就让来参加活动的客人们\n度过一段最美好的时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_i:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba7105c0f084178db29abe4ad32f56d081835b069af6d0c50f54e3a53621f8a",
      "text": "既然如此决定，便不得不探究精制术了。\n起行吧，撒旦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efd0c1d1ba0909d205414cbfd507449e85a92920bb3e0ea684013d939d7cb79d",
      "text": "户外活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3670f061e6874c7449d295548c983837a55cc9fc065c455a534ebc02af217a",
      "text": "让您久等了，这是活动限定的蛋糕☆\n……下一位客人，请点单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b17a9d44827449aff124ab5cb4c57fd8e07faf47cc249c78fa1744cfdc25d6a",
      "text": "蛋糕和红茶套餐两份对吧。\n好的。马上为您准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000072:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a88b56d9a86b4f2ef0a0fbd1594057ac78265e8ebd8d0093dfae25f4074e0ad",
      "text": "户外活动结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e2dc5a84b85ae339bb9bca1dcfafac900f5ead457fb03dc89881092b6a452f7",
      "text": "大家辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c372bdc05cc97ba38b9d7d755187e6a44847dae83b20f8054e1104f81caa04a",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n啪噼地大获成功呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48727eb64a6cc05ae90515629c7c57b56b136496cd36ecb1a097b39a5e68f2af",
      "text": "嗯！既让大家体会到了蛋糕的美妙，\n又给很多人带去了笑容，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b58ae592e0cdcedcfd529a6cf4b1a1e80f7a7e3b275a1c7901492cb095e78b3",
      "text": "那么，差不多该准备撤场了吧。\n阿斯兰先生那边能麻烦你一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:215973e44e35bf74b1981ab3dc7f1d48765ed1c8eff8d326dd8c155867e88156",
      "text": "唔，若凭借吾之魔力，\n化为虚无易如反掌！啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffad5bbe63978f48a7cab5fd037b8b0eea0f8a32e05259cf3d93f3b0162dfd2e",
      "text": "好了，等这里的收拾工作结束之后\n就去活动本部……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00ec1c9d3b9cfa5cd47dd7de51b1e4f483b69ec626b1604e3253661e26bad044",
      "text": "工作打扰了，非常抱歉。\n请问现在稍微耽搁片刻可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "可以的，没问题哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c8c38d37a52f2373476f7d8854a2b30f153202ad5e900fc50ce07ebc0bccae9",
      "text": "非常感谢。我是315 Production\n这家偶像事务所的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ea24cb37b068901f1391d25e121a5f2736c461078d4fbea16f2bd2a480831c0",
      "text": "虽然有些冒昧，大家要不要试着参加\n偶像的试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f35998eddc592bb6dd7aec0377802365e184a57cbbf71558d8929a7507825e",
      "text": "哎？试镜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bbad5f3c33290614cf1a6ae0afc2f7aba3244188718a44121fc506ebb41d705",
      "text": "是的！其实我之前就耳闻过\nCafe Parade各位的评价……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:481f6f6e179e88065449351c4a451703fbf7b65e2a4ca20bb71de29ee4d48d01",
      "text": "今天亲眼看到各位大放异彩的模样，我确信了。\n从各位身上，我感受到了作为偶像的可能性！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac548465a0e10d65bc9521cfff761e285752d08debf400331477ae9d009595ed",
      "text": "这是我的名片和关于试镜的传单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9550326048f8e69033a09b3c1204cbe7f07d76c7c097eedbe7f7ee3eeb0e26",
      "text": "不用立刻答复也没关系。\n请务必考虑一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a56b1c9704070c3c93963a8f6ea9b1390cdaf60295024042daff3a3f16863ea",
      "text": "我们去当……偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
